

---

# Dataset Availability

The experiments were conducted using the:

**Parkinson’s Progression Markers Initiative (PPMI) dataset**

PPMI is a longitudinal multi-center Parkinson’s disease dataset containing clinical, imaging, genetic, and biomarker information.

Access to PPMI data requires registration and approval through the official platform:

https://www.ppmi-info.org/


Due to data usage restrictions, raw patient-level data are not included in this repository.


